Description: Educational desktop administration suite for Linux
 Low-level Linux administration tools with real-time command previews,
 safety confirmations, and educational tooltips. Includes visual editors
 for fstab, udev rules, systemd services & timers, user groups, sudoers,
 journalctl, sysctl, POSIX ACLs, and bootloaders (GRUB & systemd-boot).
